; Types: 0 clear, 1 strategic target, 2 collect intel, 3 ammo box, 4 communications, 5 artillery, 6 fuel depot, 7 save civilians, 8 steal vehicle, 9 recover downed pilot.
; New sites use native CWA objects and scripted server-side effects.
